      "message": "this is a way, but it causes the process to remain appended. Now OFDPA comes with a service ofagentd and a configuration file /etc/ofagent/ofagent.conf.\n\nTo connect a switch, I usually uncomment the OPT_ARGS line and \nI modify it as follows:\n\nOPT_ARGS\u003d\"-d 2 -c 2 -c 4 -t POD_IP:31653 -i $DPID\"\n\nThe -d and -c params are for printing more debug info, but are not mandatory. Ask Charles for more details.\n\nThen, I do service ofagentd start/stop/restart\n\nAlso, I would substitute ONOS_FABRIC_POD with something like K8S_NODE_IP.",
